eans Career Services Welcome to the Office of Career Services! LSU New Orleans Career Services office serves as a strategic career resource and connection for LSU New Orleans students and targets career advising and preparation, candidate branding, and career events. All services are available to current students, graduates, and alumni. IN THIS SECTION Career Services About Career Services Job Location and Development Students and Alumni Internships Employers and Recruiters TypeFocus Career Assessment/Undecided Majors Career Preparation Career Readiness Career Fair Resources Career Services Team Contact Us Career Services We are here for your career development: Create a winning resume Land an exciting internship Find a job: part-time, full-time, during school and beyond Develop interviewing skills Network with local and national employers Visit our Career Closet Schedule your Professional Headshot We also host events that include: Job readiness workshops Job fairs and hiring events Fall Career Fair Spring Career Expo Instagram Facebook Twitter Linkedin Tiktok Career Services Workshops - Register for all upcoming workshops in Handshake. “I had the honor of meeting with Career Services, and they were very helpful. We discussed resume building, interviews, how to introduce myself at booths, and researching the companies before meeting and always carrying a notepad with questions. I also had the opportunity to attend some events, such as the one hosted by Northwestern Mutual. I had the opportunity to use my attire from the career closet at the Fall Career Fair. My experience with Career Services allowed me to earn my first internship with State Farm and to be invited to the Aspiring Leaders Program by Northwestern Mutual. Having the resources at Career Services has definitely helped me start my career and begin networking, especially knowing the importance of LinkedIn to connect with people!” ~Apollonia Espiritu Sophomore, Accounting Footer Contact 2000 Lakeshore Drive New Orleans, LA 70148 [email protected] [email protected] +1 (888) 514-4275 +1 (888) 514-4275 +1 (504) 384-7924 +1 (504) 384-7924 Learn Admission information Programs of study Scholarships and awards Tuition and fees Graduate programs Financial aid Important dates & deadlines Experience International center Our campus Student life Housing Career services Alumni Make a gift Annual Security Report Connect All social University calendar News For parents Espanol - Tieng Viet Privacy Policy Accessibility Non-Discrimination Title IX Campus Crime Emergency Preparedness © 2026 LSU New Orleans. All Rights Reserved."
