 Orleans Career Services Students And Alumni IN THIS SECTION Career Services About Career Services Job Location and Development Students and Alumni Internships Employers and Recruiters TypeFocus Career Assessment/Undecided Majors Career Preparation Career Readiness Career Fair Resources Career Services Team Contact Us Handshake For Jobs, Internships, and Appointments Login and customize your profile TODAY to maximize your career potential! Registration/Login Career Services Database Career Services utilizes the Handshake platform to automate the connection process for student and employer profiles, resume and cover letter uploads, job postings, internship/apprenticeship/cooperative experiences, and register for career events tailored to YOUR career interests. Get started with Handshake Every LSU New Orleans student and recent Alumni has a Handshake account registered to their LSU New Orleans student email address, but please log in and complete your profile at uno.joinhandshake.com to not miss out! (Alumni if you need an account reach out to us at [email protected] and sign up for Handshake using a personal email.) Sign in using your LSU New Orleans username and password credentials (the same that you use for Canvas, Workday, email, etc.). On your first login, you will be prompted to complete your profile and choose settings to increase Handshake's ability to match you to jobs, internships and employers that fit your interests. Settings can be changed at any time. What can you do with Handshake? Find a part-time job: on-campus, or off-campus Obtain an internship or full-time position Store resumes, cover letters, transcripts and other professional documents View a calendar of upcoming events including workshops and information sessions hosted by Career Services See which employers are coming to career fairs Schedule on-campus interviews with employers who want to hire you for a career position Interact with employers within Handshake Put your scholarship, leadership, and citizenship skills to work Need Help? Career Services Phone: 504-280-6225 General Instructions: Job Postings In Handshake, click on the Jobs & Internships tab at the left of the page. Specify the job type you are searching for (Job, Internship, On Campus Student Employment) by clicking on left filter menu. Create a saved filter by clicking on \"Save these filters\" located at the top center of the page, and labeling it appropriately. You can reuse the search by clicking on \"My Saved Filters\" which will show a list of your previously saved searches. Note that you can specify one as your default search. Learn about Upcoming Career Fairs In Handshake, click on the Search Fairs link under the Events section on the left side of the page. You will see a page listing the Career Fairs and by selecting the one you are interested in, you will see a list of employers that are attending the fair and the positions they are recruiting for. Documents In Handshake, go to Documents link under the My Profile section. Click the Add New Document button or one of the \"upload one?\" links, select the appropriate document type, and drag-and-drop the document into the drop area. Remember to label your document appropriately (ex: Jane Doe – Marketing Resume). Safety Tips Although we do our best to ensure the legitimacy of all employers, jobs, and companies on LSU New Orleans Handshake platform, please visit https://support.joinhandshake.com/hc/en-us/articles/115008792627 if you are questioning the legitimacy of a job opportunity, employer contact, email address, or company. Alternative Step-by-step instructions for Current Students to Log-in to Handshake in List Form: All current students have preloaded Handshake profiles. Go to https://www.joinhandshake.com/ Click “Log in” icon in the top right corner Enter your LSU New Orleans student email address Click “LSU New Orleans Sign On” Enter your LSU New Orleans email password Complete your profile to start discovering amazing career paths and find amazing jobs and internships! Footer Contact 2000 Lakeshore Drive New Orleans, LA 70148 [email protected] [email protected] +1 (888) 514-4275 +1 (888) 514-4275 +1 (504) 384-7924 +1 (504) 384-7924 Learn Admission information Programs of study Scholarships and awards Tuition and fees Graduate programs Financial aid Important dates & deadlines Experience International center Our campus Student life Housing Career services Alumni Make a gift Annual Security Report Connect All social University calendar News For parents Espanol - Tieng Viet Privacy Policy Accessibility Non-Discrimination Title IX Campus Crime Emergency Preparedness © 2026 LSU New Orleans. All Rights Reserved."
    },
